{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  COUNTDOWN
  Ported from gs-shopify-v3 sections/countdown.liquid
  ==================================================================
  Homepage: "FROM ASHES, UNITY" - a timer plus a product carousel,
  currently counting down to 2026-09-15.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  NULL CHECK THAT DEREFERENCES THE THING IT CHECKS
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 did:
      const swiper = document.querySelector('.countdown-offer-products.swiper');
      if (swiper.swiper) return;
  If the element is absent, `swiper.swiper` throws a TypeError before
  the guard can return - killing every listener registered after it.

  This is the THIRD instance of this exact pattern found so far, after
  layout/theme.liquid's anchor scroll and the v1 text-scroller. Worth
  grepping the whole theme for querySelector followed by an unguarded
  property access.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  MULTI-INSTANCE BUG
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Both the slider and its arrows were found with document.querySelector
  (singular). templates/index.json contains TWO countdown sections - the
  second is currently disabled. Enable it and it would not initialise,
  and its arrows would drive the first one. Everything is now scoped to
  the section id.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  data-launch-date FORMAT INCONSISTENCY - NEEDS A DECISION
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  This section emits a UNIX TIMESTAMP:
      data-launch-date="{{ setting | date: '%s' }}"
  while snippets/product-countdown.liquid emits a RAW DATE STRING from
  a metafield. Both use the same data-countdown-timer hook, so whatever
  reads them in theme.js is parsing two different formats.

  Unix seconds is kept here because it is unambiguous and timezone-safe.
  ACTION: when porting the countdown JS out of theme.js, standardise
  gs-product-countdown to emit the same format.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  HARDCODED YEAR IN THE DONATION LINE
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 rendered: "<amount> Raised To Date For 2026" with 2026 baked into
  the markup, and $5 per unit hardcoded in the maths. Both are settings
  now. The year defaults to the current year rather than a literal.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  OTHER FIXES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  1. UNTRANSLATABLE LABELS. "days" / "hrs" / "min" / "sec" were English
     literals here, though snippets/product-countdown.liquid used locale
     keys for the same labels. Now uses locale keys with fallbacks.

  2. DEAD SETTING REFERENCES. The markup referenced
     section.settings.highlight_text (for a CSS class) and
     section.settings.text_alignment (passed to the product card).
     NEITHER EXISTS in the schema. Both silently resolved to nil.

  3. MISLEADING FILTER CHAIN. The units_sold accumulator read:
         units_sold | plus: product.metafields... | default: 0
     `default` applies to the RESULT of plus, not to the metafield, so
     it never did what it looks like it does. It happens to work because
     Liquid treats nil as 0 in `plus`. Rewritten to be explicit.

  4. SWIPER REMOVED - CSS scroll-snap, reusing gs-swatch-scroller.js.
  5. AOS attributes removed (v3's enable_animation is false anyway).
  6. Dark mode block dropped; {{ settings.layout_style }} replaced with
     Dawn's page-width; t: keys replaced with English; color_scheme
     default primary -> scheme-1.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  BLOCKS (2026-09-22)
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  The copy, the timer, the product strip and the donation line are
  blocks: heading, subheading, text, timer (in block order, inside the
  text column), products and donation (after it). The section keeps
  alignment, background, colours and Dawn's padding pair: 33 settings
  became 12 plus blocks. The v3 setting ids therefore no longer apply.
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'gs-countdown.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign products_block = nil
  assign donation_block = nil
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'products'
      assign products_block = block
    elsif block.type == 'donation'
      assign donation_block = block
    endif
  endfor
  assign product_list = products_block.settings.product_list
  assign has_products = false
  if product_list.size > 0
    assign has_products = true
  endif
  assign grid_image_size = products_block.settings.grid_image_size | default: 'auto'
  assign grid_image_fit = products_block.settings.grid_image_fit | default: 'cover'
  assign units_sold = 0
  if donation_block
    for product in product_list
      assign product_units = product.metafields.custom.units_sold.value | default: 0
      assign units_sold = units_sold | plus: product_units
    endfor
    assign per_unit = donation_block.settings.per_unit | default: 5
    assign raised_cents = units_sold | times: per_unit | times: 100
  endif
-%}

<div
  class="gs-countdown color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} gradient gs-countdown--visibility-{{ section.settings.section_visibility }}"
  style="
    --padding-top: {{ s.padding_top }}px;
    --padding-bottom: {{ s.padding_bottom }}px;
    --padding-top-mobile: {{ s.padding_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    --padding-bottom-mobile: {{ s.padding_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    --image-fit: {{ grid_image_fit }};
    --offerProductWidth: {% if donation_block %}50%{% else %}75%{% endif %};
    {%- if section.settings.highlight_text_color != blank and section.settings.highlight_text_color != 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' -%}
      --countdownHighlightTextColor: {{ section.settings.highlight_text_color }};
    {%- else -%}
      --countdownHighlightTextColor: rgba(var(--line-color), 1);
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.text_color != blank and section.settings.text_color != 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' -%}
      --countdownTextColor: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    {%- else -%}
      --countdownTextColor: rgba(var(--textColor), 1);
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.bg__color == 'gradient' and section.settings.gradient_color != blank -%}
      --countdownProductBg: {{ section.settings.gradient_color }};
    {%- elsif section.settings.bg__color == 'solid' and section.settings.solid_color != blank and section.settings.solid_color != 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' -%}
      --countdownProductBg: {{ section.settings.solid_color }};
    {%- else -%}
      --countdownProductBg: rgba(var(--background), 1);
    {%- endif -%}
  "
>
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="countdown-wrapper{% if section.settings.countdown_bg_image != blank %} countdown-bg-image{% else %} countdown-bg-color{% endif %}">
      {%- if section.settings.countdown_bg_image != blank -%}
        {%- assign bg = section.settings.countdown_bg_image -%}
        <img
          class="countdown-bg"
          src="{{ bg | image_url: width: 1500 }}"
          srcset="{{ bg | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w, {{ bg | image_url: width: 1500 }} 1500w, {{ bg | image_url: width: 2000 }} 2000w"
          sizes="100vw"
          alt="{{ bg.alt | escape }}"
          width="{{ bg.width }}"
          height="{{ bg.height }}"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="countdown-offer-text text-{{ s.layout }}">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- assign b = block.settings -%}
          {%- case block.type -%}
            {%- when 'heading' -%}
              {%- if b.text != blank -%}
                <h2 class="{{ b.size | default: 'h2' }} offer-heading" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ b.text }}</h2>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- when 'subheading' -%}
              {%- if b.text != blank -%}
                <p class="{{ b.size | default: 'small-case' }} off-text" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ b.text }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- when 'text' -%}
              {%- if b.text != blank -%}
                <div class="countdown-timer-wrapper" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><p class="rte">{{ b.text }}</p></div>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- when 'timer' -%}
              {%- if b.end != blank -%}
                <div class="countdown-timer-wrapper" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                  <div
                    class="countdown-timer"
                    data-countdown-timer
                    data-launch-date="{{ b.end | date: '%s' }}"
                  >
                    <div class="count-days">
                      <span class="time days">00</span>
                      <span class="separator">{{ 'general.countdown.days' | t | default: 'days' }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="count-hours">
                      <span class="time hours">00</span>
                      <span class="separator">{{ 'general.countdown.hours' | t | default: 'hrs' }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="count-minutes">
                      <span class="time minutes">00</span>
                      <span class="separator">{{ 'general.countdown.minutes' | t | default: 'min' }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="count-seconds">
                      <span class="time seconds">00</span>
                      <span class="separator">{{ 'general.countdown.seconds' | t | default: 'sec' }}</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
          {%- endcase -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      {%- if products_block -%}
        <div class="countdown-offer-products{% if s.enable_innner_background %} background-enabled{% endif %}" {{ products_block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="gs-countdown__scroller" data-swatch-scroller>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="gs-countdown__btn"
              data-swatch-scroll="prev"
              aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.previous_slide' | t | default: 'Previous' }}"
              hidden
            >
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M15 4 L7 12 L15 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </button>

            <ul class="gs-countdown__track" data-swatch-track>
              {%- if has_products -%}
                {%- for product in product_list -%}
                  <li class="gs-countdown__slide" data-id="{{ product.id }}">
                    {%- render 'gs-card-product',
                      cardProduct: product,
                      cycleIndex: forloop.index,
                      gridImageSize: grid_image_size,
                      showCount: true,
                      quickViewtrue: true,
                      compareTrue: true,
                      showSwatches: true
                    -%}
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
                  <li class="gs-countdown__slide">
                    {%- render 'gs-card-product',
                      cycleIndex: forloop.index,
                      gridImageSize: grid_image_size
                    -%}
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            </ul>

            <button
              type="button"
              class="gs-countdown__btn"
              data-swatch-scroll="next"
              aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.next_slide' | t | default: 'Next' }}"
              hidden
            >
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M9 4 L17 12 L9 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if donation_block -%}
        <div class="donation-impact-text" style="--donationImpactFontColor: {{ donation_block.settings.color | default: '#ffffff' }};" {{ donation_block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <p>
            <span>{{ raised_cents | money }}</span>
            {{ donation_block.settings.label | default: 'Raised To Date For' }}
            {{ donation_block.settings.year | default: 'now' | date: '%Y' }}
          </p>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Countdown",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "countdown-section",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": [
      "header",
      "footer"
    ]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "General"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_visibility",
      "label": "Show section on",
      "default": "always",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "always",
          "label": "All devices"
        },
        {
          "value": "small",
          "label": "Mobile only"
        },
        {
          "value": "large",
          "label": "Desktop only"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text_alignment",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "Content alignment",
      "default": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Background"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "countdown_bg_image",
      "label": "Background image"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "bg__color",
      "label": "Product area background",
      "default": "gradient",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "gradient",
          "label": "Gradient"
        },
        {
          "value": "solid",
          "label": "Solid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "color_background",
      "id": "gradient_color",
      "label": "Gradient",
      "default": "linear-gradient(320deg, rgba(56, 78, 197, 0.56) 16%, rgba(203, 68, 194, 0.6) 52%, rgba(255, 201, 104, 0.95) 87%)"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "solid_color",
      "label": "Solid color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "enable_innner_background",
      "label": "Show background behind products",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Custom colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "highlight_text_color",
      "label": "Highlight text color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "default": 12
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Countdown",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading"
        },
        {
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "timer"
        },
        {
          "type": "products"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "name": "Heading",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "inline_richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Heading",
          "default": "Countdown heading"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "size",
          "label": "Size",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "h1",
              "label": "H1"
            },
            {
              "value": "h2",
              "label": "H2"
            },
            {
              "value": "h3",
              "label": "H3"
            },
            {
              "value": "h4",
              "label": "H4"
            }
          ],
          "default": "h2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "subheading",
      "name": "Subheading",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "inline_richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Subheading"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "size",
          "label": "Size",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "small-case",
              "label": "Small"
            },
            {
              "value": "medium-case",
              "label": "Medium"
            },
            {
              "value": "large-case",
              "label": "Large"
            }
          ],
          "default": "small-case"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Text",
      "limit": 2,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "inline_richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timer",
      "name": "Timer",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "end",
          "label": "Ends at",
          "info": "Format YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM, e.g. 2026-12-31 23:59"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "products",
      "name": "Products",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "product_list",
          "id": "product_list",
          "label": "Products",
          "limit": 16
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "grid_image_size",
          "label": "Image shape",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "auto",
              "label": "Natural"
            },
            {
              "value": "landscape",
              "label": "Landscape"
            },
            {
              "value": "portrait",
              "label": "Portrait"
            },
            {
              "value": "square",
              "label": "Square"
            }
          ],
          "default": "auto"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "grid_image_fit",
          "label": "Image fit",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "cover",
              "label": "Cover"
            },
            {
              "value": "contain",
              "label": "Contain"
            }
          ],
          "default": "cover"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "donation",
      "name": "Donation impact",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "Sums the custom.units_sold metafield of the products above."
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "per_unit",
          "label": "Donation per unit sold",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 50,
          "step": 1,
          "unit": "$",
          "default": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "label",
          "label": "Label",
          "default": "Raised To Date For"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "year",
          "label": "Year",
          "info": "Empty uses the current year."
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "color",
          "label": "Text color",
          "default": "#ffffff"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
